<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Hartebeest Dec qtr profit flat.</title>
<headline>Hartebeest Dec qtr profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gold profit			    77.18 vs 74.01</p>
<p>    Capital spending			7.56 vs  8.08</p>
<p>Underground -</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		     5,997 vs 6,273</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		    1,199,000 vs 1,231,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			  5.00 vs 5.10</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			43,715 vs 42,410</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		   56,584 vs 54,207</p>
<p>Full name: Hartebeestfontein Gold Mining Co Ltd, managed by Avgold, formerly gold mines under Anglovaal Ltd.</p>
<p>NOTE - Outstanding capital expenditure commitments at December 31, 1996 are estimated at 12.49 million rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
